window.products.push({"id":766107,"name":"Beautyrest 3\" Convoluted Foam Mattress Topper, Queen","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71AcVXWiY7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"3\" TOPPER: At 3\" thick, this topper is the perfect means of achieving restful sleep every night of the year. Designed to deliver a rejuvenating sleep experience, you will wake up each morning feeling rested and ready to take on the day with vigor. CONVOLUTED DESIGN: The convoluted construction of this topper is designed to reduce stress on common pressure points, supporting your body as you sleep. The convoluted construction does not flatten over time, constantly providing support to the areas that need it most, for ultimate sleeping satisfaction. INCREASES COMFORT: This topper instantly increases the comfort of your current bed, adding an extra layer of luxury to your sleeping space. Easily drift off into restful sleep each night by simply introducing this topper into your sleeping space. Creating the optimal sleeping landscape has never been easier. BEFORE USE: Make sure that you unroll it completely and do not touch it for 24-48 hours. The mattress topper will appear flat and unusable, but it will expand and fluff up to its true size within the next day or two. When it has returned to its true size, simply place in the middle of the bed—do not line up with the corners—and make your bed as usual. Most importantly, if you do lay on it before the 24-48 hour period is over, it will not recover, so please do not lay on it until it has returned to its true size.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71AcVXWiY7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beautyrest","source_asin":"B01969QAXG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-766107","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01969QAXG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01969QAXG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
