window.products.push({"id":766142,"name":"HOMEFLA Office Executive Ergonomic Computer PU Leather High Back Desk Swivel Comfortable Rolling Chair with Adjustable Armrests, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TEXUGoLuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Recliner Function & Adjustable Soft Armrests】The max reclining angle for this computer chair is about 105°. While seated, lift the third lever up(next to the chair back), let your chair tilt back, then pull the third lever down, lock the tilt angle. Press the button on the armrests, you can lock any height you need. The armrests are soft, comfortable for you to work or relax. 【Height Adjustment & Liftable Chair Back】This office chair features with adjustable height (Full height: 43-46 inches), so you can adjust the seat height according to your needs. The high back design features ergonomic and comfortable padding of the backrest, extending to the upper back for greater and gentle support. Loosen the knob on the chair back to raise the chair back individually, then tighten the knob, making the chair suitable for taller customers. 【Rocking Mode & Swivels 360°】You can swing back and forth if you lift the second lever while seated. You also can lock the seat angle if you pull the second lever down. The chair easily swivels 360 degrees to get the maximum use of your workspace without strain but also keeps you steady when you need to work. This office chair has a 280 pounds weight capacity for long-lasting use. 【Comfortable Pad & Ergonomic Design】Our office chair aims to optimize the seating experience and provide good support and comfort. When you sat for long periods, a well-designed and ergonomic chair is essential for your lumbar support. This executive chair is made of bonded leather, that provides you with 24 hours of extreme sitting comfort and is suitable for office or home use. 【Warm Tips】Our office chair will come together with all hardware & necessary tools. Please follow the instruction to assemble it. We will provide an accessories replacement service, so please feel free to contact us if there is any problem. We will try our best to solve the product problems for you. Included components: body, leg,assemble tool, instruction","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TEXUGoLuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HOMEFLA","source_asin":"B09T2S7TXF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-766142","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09T2S7TXF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09T2S7TXF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
