window.products.push({"id":766246,"name":"SLEEP ZONE Thermal Insulated Blackout Curtains for Bedroom, Room Darkening, Noise Reducing, Grommet Top Window Drapes (2 Panels, White, 52\" W x 95\" L)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61uFOTcpcML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【INNOVATIVE BLACKOUT DESIGN】 - We upgraded the triple-weave process: the outer layer is made of polyester colored yarn, the middle & inner layers are both made of high-density black yarn to achieve a better shading effect (100% shading for dark curtains, 95% shading for light curtains). Compared with the ordinary triple-weave curtains (not 100% shading as claimed) and double-layer curtains (heavy & expensive), our curtains provide the perfect balance of shading and weight 【SUPERIOR MATERIAL】 - This curtain is made of 330D polyester yarn compared to the common used 280-300D thread. The higher the D number, the finer the yarn, making it denser and more wear-resistant. Fade free, and machine wash durable. It's smooth, wrinkle-free, looking shiny. Exquisite tailored and come in classic solid hues. It's not only a functional piece but also an elegant decoration for your room 【THERMAL INSULATION】 - This curtain can completely keep out the sunlight and UV ray to protect your furniture and floor. It also insulates against summer heat and winter chill to balance your room temperature, cutting down energy bills. 【NOISE REDUCTION】 - This curtain can be a good sense of drape, making the window fully closed to reduce noise. The benefit is to offer you a restful environment and strengthen privacy protection 【WIDELY COMPATIBLE】 - It comes in a set of two panels with six stainless grommets per panel, measuring 1.6-inch inner diameter each. (tiebacks not included). Available in various colors and sizes, it fits well with standard or decorative curtain rods, making the curtains easy to install and slide. This pair of blackout drapes are suitable for most windows of bedrooms, living rooms. It's a must-have piece for every home and also widely used in hotels, offices, schools,... 【SATISFACTION PROMISE】 - We have more than 40 years of experience in the design and manufacture of high-quality bedding. All our products have been certified by Oeko-Tex Standard 100 to be free of harmful chemicals, ensuring that they're safe, healthy for you and your family. You can buy with confidence under our excellent product quality and customer service. If you have any inquiries or issues, please feel free to contact us, we’ll get back to you within 24hours","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61uFOTcpcML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SLEEP ZONE","source_asin":"B09BJN859N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-766246","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09BJN859N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09BJN859N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
