window.products.push({"id":766338,"name":"Richards Homewares Multi-Functional 2-Shelf Shower Caddy, 12 x 26.75 x 4.3-Inch, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/615VC9nC0ES._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The modern design of this caddy will look great with any decor. Organize your shower items easily. Keep bottles off the floor. Designed with a dual function. Hang it from a showerhead or over a shower curtain rod. It can even hang over a glass enclosed shower wall. The two shelves have holes to securely hold bottles upside down to get every last drop. There are 4 hooks at the bottom to hold wash cloths, brushes or razors. Made of sturdy polypropylene with flexible TPR arms. This caddy is rustproof. The distance between the shelves is approximately 9.5-Inch so even large bottles can be stored. Four suction cups easily attach and hold the caddy securely in place. Dimensions are 12.6 x 28.7 x 4.3-Inch when arms are straight. When hung on a showerhead the dimensions are approximately 12 x 26.75 x 4.3-Inch.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/615VC9nC0ES._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Richards","source_asin":"B09FFZ7VG7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-766338","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09FFZ7VG7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09FFZ7VG7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
