window.products.push({"id":766514,"name":"Chef Knife Bag Folding Knife Bag | 20+ Pockets for Knives & Kitchen Tools | Large Pocket for Tablet & Notebooks | 500D Fortified Nylon | Knife Backpac","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61kSmI3vBDS._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"🔪 EXTREMELY DURABLE + SOLID BUILD - Enjoy years of daily use and get your money’s worth from this portable and well-built knife bags for chefs! For maximum durability, Chef Sac chef knife bags are made from high-quality premium 600D industrial-grade fabric. Reinforced double stitching offers extra protection against tears. Sturdy for any commercial kitchen or private catering. This chef backpack comes with a hidden back pocket for storing a tablet, notebook or your secret recipe book. 🔪 SECURE & ORGANIZED STORAGE SPACE - You don’t have to play favorites anymore! With over 20 pockets to securely cradle your precious “culinary babies”, you can now take your entire kitchen arsenal in this knife organizer wherever you go. This is no small knife bag! Strap knives, tools, and equipment up to 18” long. Dedicated pockets for honing rod & cleaver; pack extra tools in the zippered pouch; and carry kitchenware, electronics, notebooks, business cards and more in the large compartment! 🔪 LIGHTWEIGHT, WATER RESISTANT, EASY TO CARRY - We kept this folding knife bag lightweight & added easy adjustable knife backpack shoulder straps for ultimate comfort and travel mobility. We know how heavy knives and tools can get. We back our sacs and chefs case! A refreshing, visually pleasing chefs knife bag brings style & high fashion into the kitchen. All you need to kick butt in the kitchen in one awesome portable knife carrier and luggage carrying solution! 🔪 HEAD-TURNER DESIGN - 86 the old and get this new backpack knife bag. Chef Sac is chef-inspired & designed to create the ultimate knife carrying case. Designed for Culinary Mavericks and chefs on the move looking for a travel knife bag with a superb sense of style! Reinforced extra-thick, double stitching & heavy-duty zippers help to last through years of kitchen wear & tear. We want to help you make great dishes in the kitchen and make a one-of-a-kind impression when out in the open. 🔪 PERFECT FOR PROFESSIONALS & STUDENTS - Looking for chef knife bags and cases? Your search ends here. Knife bags for chefs professional head chef, sous chef, line cook or culinary student. An ultimate chef knife case to carry your money-making tools. The discrete design shows no knives, so no one will know the expensive knives you’re carrying inside this chef backpack tool bag. Solid build, compact size, spacious, secure storage, modern design—all the values a chef wants.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61kSmI3vBDS._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Chef Sac","source_asin":"B0919D1WH2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-766514","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0919D1WH2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0919D1WH2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
