window.products.push({"id":766604,"name":"Level Up Way –25 Ounce Premium Stainless Steel Water Bottle with Filter – BPA Free - Travel Essentials - Alkaline Water Filter pH 9+ (Blue)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sWgwY1SwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"GREAT TASTING WATER: Whether you are an outdoor lover or you want to experience water's natural, fresh taste, our WATER FILTER BOTTLE is a must-have. Known to turn ALKALINE LEVELS pH+, the water bottle with straw is the optimal solution for a Healthy Lifestyle. MADE to LAST: The body of our TRAVEL BOTTLE is made of durable and reliable Double Wall Insulated STAINLESS STEEL, a material that is bound to pass the test of time and keeps water cold for 24 hours. EFFICIENT WATER FILTERING: This unique water purifier features an efficient water filter that will stop any residual chlorine, heavy metals, or other harmful substances from municipal water or rivers, lakes, moors, streams, ponds, and springs and should be replaced after 40 gallons or approximately every two months. INNOVATIVE Mobile App: One of the best parts about our large water bottles is that they come with a super convenient app that reminds you when to change the filter. The smartphone app works perfectly with android and apple devices. EXCELLENT PRESENT: Surprise your friends, colleagues, or family members with a practical reusable water bottle that can help filter harmful substances from different water sources. It makes a fantastic present for birthdays, anniversaries, graduation days, Christmas, or special occasions.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sWgwY1SwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Level Up Way","source_asin":"B0BMBCQK6R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-766604","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BMBCQK6R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BMBCQK6R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
