window.products.push({"id":766684,"name":"Leonyo Wooden Pepper Mill with 2PCS Meat Tenderizers, Adjustable Wood Pepper Salt Grinder with Stainless Steel Needle Tenderizers for Flat Top Grill C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81B7mU-6sYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Perfect combination for tastier meat, come with wooden pepper mill and 2pcs meat tenderizer, needle tenderizers can be used to beat all kinds of meat like pork, veal, chicken, steak, wooden pepper grinder helps to add small particles of spices or salt to make the meat more delicious Premium wood salt and pepper grinder, made of premium solid wood, this elegant grinder is sturdy, durable and suitable for indoor and outdoor cooking; we do not use plastic material but a ceramic rotor, make it safe and more effortless to grind; for fine grinding, you only need to gently tighten the nut clockwise while twisting the nut counterclockwise slightly for coarse grinding Food grade stainless steel needle tenderizer, 20-pin stainless steel prongs are food grade and not easy to rust, break down meat fibers or connective tissues, make marinade to be absorbed faster and more fully, also speed up cooking; tenderizer keeps meat shape and fibers well while meat hammer/mallet destroy shape and fibers. Ergonomic design, both handle of needle tenderizers and wooden pepper grinder are non-slip and comfortable to hold and use; there is a premium plastic disc covering the needles to avoid stabs and scratches while non-baffle tenderizers would easily hurt your hands or scratch anything in contact with the needles, meat residues can only stay on the disc, easy to clean; you can fine grind or rough grind by adjusting the tightness of the nut Easy to clean, a long brush is included for cleaning the tenderizers and pepper mill more easily, the size of brush head is suitable for cleaning the gap between the needles; and it is longer than the pepper mill so you could easily brush inside and the bottom of the grinder after taking off the cover","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81B7mU-6sYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Leonyo","source_asin":"B093GZTKQ2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-766684","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B093GZTKQ2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B093GZTKQ2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":766685,"name":"FOLKOR LIFE Natural Agate Coaster Set of 4, 3.5-4\" Crystalline Geode Stone Coasters for Drinks Coffee Table Decor Agate Slices Glass Cups Holder for H","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81PqpiZt7eL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍸Natural Beauty for Home - Try something new to refresh your home! Hand-picked cystalline agate coasters add sophisticated touch to your table, incorporating natural elements into your home decor. 【Note: Each piece you received will have snowflake-like pattern inside, but the color might be white, gray or black.】To maximize the natural beauty, the rocky edges have been left untouched. 🍷Unique Beauty for You - Differ from pictures? The agates are formed by the nature itself! When going through the cutting process, the coasters vary in shape, size and thickness. No two agate coasters are identical. Each one you received is the last one in the world. Really special and amazing, right? 🍺Trendy yet Functional - These beautiful sliced stones coasters are fashioned into functional decor details. Complement wine, coffee, drink or beverage. Size: 3.5-4” (irregular), applicable to mug, cocktail glass or tea cups, adding elegance to your tabletop, coffee table or bar. Except for working as table coasters, these agate slices is good for holding candles, fragrance, DIY project or wall art, more for you to explore! ☕Safe to Use - This stone coaster set comes with 50 anti-skid rubber bumper. Fix 4 pieces on the bottom of each agate coaster to protect your furniture’s surface and prevent skidding. 【Note】①These coasters are NOT water absorbent due to natural agate stone material.②Some stones might have small holes and depressions as they are natural. 🥂Stunning Gift for Anyone and Any Occasions - This natural geode coaster set will surely be impressed by your guests in a party or surprise the one receives it. Natural, stylish and special, these drink coasters are a perfect hostess or housewarming gift for your family, friends and lover. Suitable for birthday, anniversary, wedding and any other occasions!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81PqpiZt7eL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FOLKOR LIFE","source_asin":"B0BNHY3T98","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-766685","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BNHY3T98","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BNHY3T98","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
