window.products.push({"id":766747,"name":"LifePlus Evaporative Air Cooler, 1800 CFM Swamp Cooler with Remote Control, 5.2 Gallon Large Water Tank, 3 Speed Cooling Fan, 4 Ice Packs, Portable Ai","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":169.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711husP1acL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Powerful Cooling Effect]- Do not let ordinary tower fans limit your imagination with this evaporative cooler fan! The 1800 CFM swamp cooler can handle spaces up to 300 sq. ft. It's a 3-in-1 portable cooling fan that blows, humidifies, and cools the air. Use two ice boxes for help cool the water faster. This evaporative cooler is perfect for your room with less energy and comfortable humidity. [Two Ways of Adding Water]- The evaporative air cooler is designed 2 ways to add water, the way of manually adding water at the top allows you to operate easily without bending over. Of course, we also have the option of automatic water filling by connecting a standard garden hose to the included water hose adapter. Large enough 5.2 gallon water tank for 10 hours of self-contained cooling, refilling once a day. [2 Modes and 3 Speeds]- This swamp cooler offers you the most personalized results. Customize the speed of air circulation with 3 wind speeds and 2 selectable wind modes. Normal mode provides steady airflow. Natural mode constantly changes between different wind intensities. You can easily find a mode that suits your taste. [Adjustable Wind Direction]- The automatic horizontal oscillation feature allows you to adjust it to a 60° setting. Vertical airflow can also be adjusted through its manual shutters for maximum cooling. Ensures air is evenly distributed throughout the room, providing a comfortable breeze. [Movable to Anywhere Use]- There are 4 x 360° caster wheels, which are convenient for you to move the swamp cooler in different places. The portable air cooler weighs 13 lbs and has a handle for easy lifting and flexible storage. So this air cooler fan is not limited to one place, you are free to move it to any space when you need cooling, whether it is the backyard, garage, patio, room or more. ♥Customer Service: It support 12 months warranty service. If the product has any problems, please contact us as soon as possible, we will do our best to help you solving it.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711husP1acL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LifePlus","source_asin":"B0B6Z3VY76","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-766747","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B6Z3VY76","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B6Z3VY76","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
