window.products.push({"id":766771,"name":"casaWare Ceramic Coated NonStick 9-Inch Pie Pan (Silver Granite)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81FzbsFdoTL._AC_SL1445_.jpg","description":"The 9-Inch casaWare Pie Pan is designed for that perfect pie! This pan has two nonstick ceramic coatings that it both durable and easy to clean. The cream colored nonstick ceramic surface is PTFE Free, Cadmium Free, Lead Free, PFOA Free, and PFOS Free. The base of the 9\" Pie Pan is fashion colored, high heat resistant nonstick. This pan also fits most toaster ovens. USE and CARE Instructions: Before First Use- Remove all packaging materials and labels. Wash in warm soapy water. Rinse and dry thoroughly with a soft cloth. UTENSILS - Plastic, rubber, silicone or wooden utensils are recommended. Avoid using any sharp objects or metal utensils because they can scratch any non-stick surface. Always remove food from the pan before slicing or cutting. CLEANING - Cool completely before washing. Hand wash with a soft cloth or sponge and nonabrasive cleansers or liquid dishwashing soap in warm water. Rinse and then dry with a soft towel.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81FzbsFdoTL._AC_SL1445_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"casaWare","source_asin":"B07TSQ6HSK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-766771","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07TSQ6HSK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07TSQ6HSK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
