window.products.push({"id":766949,"name":"AFRICAN WALL ART,AFRICAN AMERICAN Print Décor for Home & Living Room, Adinkra Symbols African Art Décor on Cotton Canvas. Celebrate Black Culture & An","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81w3nqAUznL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SEE WHAT 'ADINKRA' SPEAKS TO YOU What is Adinkra? Adinkra Symbols are a form of African wall decor ancient Ghanain indigenous symbolic form of communication  representing a philosophical, educational and moral values system of the people of Akan West Africa in regards to American History Surround yourself with messages of African American ancient wisdom, that can help guide us even centuries later. ✅ Easy to hang ✅ Premium quality canvas  ✅ Surround yourself with wisdom & guidance ✅ Perfect bedroom wall art  These nonverbal images are like present urban day “icons” only with ancient ancestral connections. They communicate principles of values, ethics, behavoir.  Initiative, cooperation and  social and historical events including political and judicial elements, and social and religious norms","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81w3nqAUznL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B08LJVPS5V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-766949","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08LJVPS5V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08LJVPS5V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":766950,"name":"Mauviel M'150 B 1.5mm Polished Copper & Stainless Steel Oval Frying Pan With Bronze Handles, 11.8-in, Made in France","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51cL3dj3oFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Mauviel M 'Heritage M150B Copper Cookware combines two efficient materials that are perfect for cooking and table presentation. The 100% Copper body is 1.5mm thick and is bonded to a very thin stainless interior. Copper offers superior heat conductivity. Stainless Steel interior is hard wearing, non-reactive and ideal for all types of cooking activities, is easy to clean and very durable. Mauviel M 'Heritage M150B has straight sides and substantial bronze handles that are firmly riveted to the body with stainless steel rivets. The handles are traditional and offer excellent balance. Made in France. Mauviel, a French family business established in 1830 and located in the Normandy town of Villedieu-les-Poeles, is the foremost manufacturer of professional copper cookware in the world today. Highly regarded in the professional world, with over 170-Year of experience, Mauviel offers several different lines of copper cookware to professional chefs and home cooks that appreciate the benefits of their high quality products. Professional cooks can attest that copper cookware is an essential part of every cookware collection as it is 2X more conductive than aluminum and 10X more conductive than stainless steel. This advantage makes copper the very best material for cooking, as it is unsurpassed in its ability to heat up evenly and rapidly and to cool down quickly, allowing for maximum control and great cooking results.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51cL3dj3oFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mauviel","source_asin":"B0161Q2FDG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-766950","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0161Q2FDG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0161Q2FDG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":766951,"name":"38 Pcs Mardi Gras Party Swirls Hanging Foil Swirl Streamers with Mardi Gras Banner Tinsel Garland Crepe Paper Streamers for Mardi Gras New Orleans Bac","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/910xGNfEDML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Quantity: This Mardi Gras Party Decoration Supplies includes 23 Pcs Mardi Gras Hanging Swirl Streamers (20 Pcs single swirls with paper cutouts or foil cutouts and 3 Pcs plain double swirls), 1 MARDI GRAS Letter Banner (9 Pcs paper cutouts and 6.6 feet yellow raffia cord), 2 Pcs Mardi Gras Tinsel Garlands (2 styles), and 12 Pcs Mardi Gras Crepe Paper Rolls in purple, green, and yellow gold. Dimensions: Assorted Mardi Gras Cutouts measure appr. 2.9\"-8.3\" in length and 3.1\"-9.5\" in width. Single swirls with cutouts are appr. 38.6\" long and plain double swirls are appr. 27.6\" long. The MARDI GRAS Letter Banner is appr. 4.9 feet in length. Each Mardi Gras Tinsel Garland is appr. 6.4 feet in length. Each Mardi Gras Crepe Paper Roll measures appr. 82 ft. long and 1.8\" wide. Color: The Mardi Gras Party Swirls feature assorted crown cutout, fleur de lis cutout, masquerade mask cutout, hat cutout, drum cutout, horn cutout, guitar cutout and maracas cutout hanging from shimmering purple, green and gold swirls. The Mardi Gras Tinsel Garlands and Crepe Paper Streamers are in gold, purple and green. Material: Mardi Gras party foils are Foil Swirl. The Mardi Gras Cutouts are made of 129lbs (350GSM) cardstock (clearly printed on both sides) and foil, pre-punched for easy hanging. The MARDI GRAS Letter Banner is made of 111lb (300GSM) cardstock and printed on one side. The Mardi Gras Streamers are made of Crepe Paper that has fine texture and soft to touch. This Set of Mardi Gras Party Supplies is perfect for Mardi Gras celebration, Fat Tuesday, New Orleans themed bachelorette party, wedding, birthday party, or kid's room, bedroom, classroom, nursery and school. You can combine these gold, purple and green decorations together to create a dazzling party backdrop or use them to decorate separate party areas.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/910xGNfEDML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Winlyn","source_asin":"B0827LZ4G5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-766951","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0827LZ4G5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0827LZ4G5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
